<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT MALAYSIA 3-1 IN WORLD YOUTH CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT MALAYSIA 3-1 IN WORLD YOUTH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SHAH ALAM, Malaysia 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco beat</p>
<p>Malaysia 3-1 (halftime 2-1) in the inaugural match of the</p>
<p>bienniel FIFA World Youth Cup soccer tournament at the Shah Alam</p>
<p>stadium on Monday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Morocco - Tarik Sektioui 14, Khalid Khamma 31, Aissam</p>
<p>Barroudi 90</p>
<p>Malaysia - Youssef Safri 11, own goal</p>
</text>
